{"ID":"20240314091803-3ufe79h","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091803-3ufe79h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091803-3ufe79h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171235-bmdzjbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171235-2mruxkd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171235-2mruxkd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:209,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:209\u0026#125;","title":"【阳旦汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171235-bmdzjbi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-bmdzjbi","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后风，续续数十日不解，头微疼，恶寒，时时有热，心下闷，干呕，汗出，虽久，阳旦证续在者，可与阳旦汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-0x1ell5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-0x1ell5","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳旦汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-w8w1113","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-w8w1113","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两去皮芍药三两甘草二两炙生姜三两切大枣十二枚劈牡桂四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-u8xedj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-u8xedj9","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后风啊，能够"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"续续数十日不解"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一直感觉身体老是不舒服，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头呢稍微有点痛，也不是强烈的痛，有一点恶寒，常常有点发热，那胃里面闷闷的，吃不下东西，那干呕，也有流汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这都是因为她本身生完小孩以后，就气血两虚，又吹到风导致的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虽久，阳旦证续在者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，虽然你得病那么久，可能一个月，两个月，三个月还有这个症状，还是可以给她阳旦汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-g3vd61s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-g3vd61s","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中国人呢，我们才会说坐月子，生完小孩以后要保护，老外不是这样子啊！老外生完小孩第二天就跳到游泳池里面去了，我那个大嫂就这样子啊！她就跳到游泳池里面去，我都来不及阻止。因为我整天在台湾嘛，她生完第二天就跳到游泳池里面去了，结果现在全身关节都在痛，因为他们不了解怎么保养，所以你不能学老外啊。我们讲这个美国女人啊，因为美国人只花了两百年研究怎么上太空，中国人他有五千年研究如何吃啊！所以我们身体很好，有些太太到了四五十岁可能看上去还很年轻。那美国人呢，不是这样子的，二十几岁的太太或者是二十几岁的小伙子，刚结完婚以后，我们就形容他，美国的女人像美国的车子啊，买来时新的，三年以后就老掉了（众笑）。就很苍老，所以常常会看错。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-0wxafw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-0wxafw1","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如夫妻两个进来，你以为是妈妈带着儿子，实际上他就是生完小孩跳到游泳池里面去哦（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"调侃的说法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），他们有很多很多的坏习惯。跟她讲她也不听啊，觉得说我们美国人都到太空去了，你们还在那里，所以他们觉得自己是对的，实际上她完全错了，她不会听你的，不听没关系，那你就老嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-v35vhi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-v35vhi0","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果会保养，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"产后风"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按照这种方式来保养，我告诉你，你可以把你太太养的很漂亮，生完小孩还是很漂亮哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-6ue3fdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-6ue3fdm","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个阳旦汤呢，实际是什么，就是桂枝加桂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们奔豚也是这个处方啊。这个阳旦汤呢，是因为生完小孩以后气血两虚，然后得到中风。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加肉桂的目的是什么？让心脏的力量加强"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以中医北派...我们经方的观念是行阳，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳气能够旺的话，阴能够自回"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个人到了十几天、二十几天、数至十日，到了两个三个月以后，这个症还在那边，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"代表阳气就是回不来，但是又不是很虚弱，所以你用桂枝汤，重用加点肉桂下去就好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-3qofluq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-3qofluq","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"阳回推阴20240415_151058"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/阳回推阴20240415_151058-20240415151135-nk50uhj.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422171235-2mruxkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171235-2mruxkd","updated":"20240422171235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你这个煮汤，我们会加点肉桂的时候，比如我们桂枝三钱，芍药三钱，炙甘草二钱，生姜两片啊，红枣十二个，我们六碗水煮成两碗，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个牡桂不要放下去煮，直接生用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你可以加一点，不要一汤匙，一勺太多了啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般的汤匙的话，平的半勺就可以了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一勺太辣了哦，太多了很呛鼻啊！那你洒一点牡桂，生用以后心脏的力量就加强，这个阳就回来，阳一回来一推阴，阴就开始这个，就会这样走（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"前文有提及，8字形，肚脐以下，顺时针走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），阳下来以后，阴会自回。"}]}]}